# Dependencies
node_modules/

# Build outputs
dist/
build/
.vite/

# Environment files
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local

# Log files
*.log
npm-debug.log*

# Editor directories
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*.swo

# OS generated files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Test coverage
coverage/

# Temporary files
tmp/
temp/

# Educational notes:
# - `node_modules/` is always environment-specific; never commit it.
# - `dist/` and `build/` are compiled outputs; CI or release pipelines should produce them.
# - `.env*` files often contain secrets (API keys). Commit an `.env.example` instead if needed.
# - `.vite/` contains dev server cache artifacts; safe to delete to “reset” weird build issues.
